#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 106
#: rc.cpp:36
msgid ""
"<h1>Keyboard Layout</h1> Here you can choose your keyboard layout and model. "
"The 'model' refers to the type of keyboard that is connected to your "
"computer, while the keyboard layout defines \"which key does what\" and may "
"be different for different countries."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Rengê Klavyeyê</h1> Li virê dikarî reng û medela klavyeyê hilbijêrî. "
"'Model' li gorî klavyeya bi komputera te ve girêdayî ye, di rengê klavyeyê  "
"de\"kîjan bişkojk çi dike\" li gorî welatê lê dijî diguhere."

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 127
#: rc.cpp:39
msgid "Keyboard &model:"
msgstr "Klavye &model:"

#. i18n: tag string
#. i18n: file kcmlayoutwidget.ui line 144
#: rc.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Here you can choose a keyboard model. This setting is independent of your "
"keyboard layout and refers to the \"hardware\" model, i.e. the way your "
"keyboard is manufactured. Modern keyboards that come with your computer "
"usually have two extra keys and are referred to as \"104-key\" models, which "
"is probably what you want if you do not know what kind of keyboard you "
"have.\n"
msgstr ""
"Li virê dikarî modeleke klavyeyê hilbijêrî. Ev ji rengê klavyeya te cuda ye "
"û li gorî modela \"reqalav\"ê ye. Klavyeyên modern bi komputerê re tên, bi "
"piranî wekî modela \"104-bişkojk\" du bilkojkên wan ên zêde hene.\n"

